Drop the Windows icon here as `icon.ico` before running `npm run dist:win`.

Requirements:
  - filename: icon.ico (exact, lowercase)
  - format:   Windows .ico (multi-resolution preferred; include 256x256, 128x128, 64x64, 48x48, 32x32, 16x16)
  - location: build/icon.ico (this directory)

If the file is absent, the build still succeeds — electron-builder falls
back to the default Electron icon for the installer, and the
BrowserWindow comes up with no custom icon.
